From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Daniel Campos Ramos <Capitain_Jack@yahoo.com>
Date: Tue, 3 Nov 2026 23:02:11 -0300
Subject: [PATCH 12/19] kcm: Keep the screen names on the screens while the
 view is open

A Show Screen Names item in the View menu keeps KWin's Identify Screens labels on every
screen while the arrangement view is on screen, as wdisplays keeps its overlay, by showing
them again every two seconds before KWin's two and a half seconds end, and hides them when
the item is switched off or the page closes. The choice is kept in kcm_kscreenrc and is off
until the person switches it on, as Identify Screens was the only way before.

Assisted-by: Claude Sonnet 5.5
